vocal-plasma (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Vocal Plasma
  * High-quality text-to-speech for KDE Plasma desktop
  * Text-to-Speech using Kokoro ONNX neural network model
  * Supports multiple voices (American/British, Male/Female)
  * Includes command-line interface and KDE Plasma shortcuts (Alt+Esc)
  * Bundled with Kokoro v1.0 model and voice embeddings

 -- Package Maintainer <maintainer@example.com>  Sun, 01 Dec 2025 12:00:00 +0000